# Run only in an isolated NUS_SHOT profile. This uses app handlers, not OS input.
wait 800
key escape
home
homelook art space
window 1280 800
wait 1500
assertspace ready
assertspace earth
shot space-home-earth
key f6
key tab
key enter
assertspace held
shot space-home-held
key left
key enter
assertspace moving
awaitspace outward
assertspace outward
shot space-home-darkroom
window 540 780
wait 500
assertspace ready
shot space-home-narrow
key escape
hometype ? a real native prompt
wait 200
shot space-home-typing
homeclear
quit
